title: Home Broadband
text: Both of you are working from home today, and both your desks at the office want you logged in. There is one line out of the house.
trick: only two teleporters and one line between the buildings, yet two colours to send: red and blue must be merged on a splitter into one magenta beam, sent down the single tunnel, and parted again by a prism at the far end
motif: pictogram: a house with a pitched roof and an office block, sealed; a town of occupied squares between them
expect: merges>=1
